            "♻️ <b>Reset Rank</b>\n\n"
            "Reply with the User ID of the trainer to reset.\n\n"
            "This resets:\n"
            "Rank → Rookie\n"
            "EXP → 0\n\n"
            "Inventory and Pokémon are NOT affected.\n\n"
